      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "花的气味，原来是生命的气味啊。\n……我打从心底这么觉得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5721b02ae482563b1dc694924b049324b0a1524f0479e1630762c91c493855",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
