      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那真是不可思议。花的香气，仿佛为患者们的\n脸庞注入了生气。\n……我的心，也变得非常温暖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8796f1174561cc51284972e4706289520be87e660c04670835c7cd3b4ee7ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
